{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act8mini_level_act8mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act8mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "我無懼前路何往",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act8mini/level_act8mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9c6520677a1642b72a8ab0a31ae5b667d61f6741c7785be626d0cf513bef089f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的說辭並不重要。於每刻踐行自己的意志，才算是真正地活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去親歷這片大地吧。獨屬於你的思想，需要歲月來澆鑄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，我希望你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5:39 P.M. 天氣/晴\n室外，羅德島甲板"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近很忙吧，有許多需要處理的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "適當休息也是必要的，你的生理指標近期有一些小的波動，我會持續關注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，煌會在今晚來向你作簡報，她主導了昨天的突襲作戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1:23 A.M. 天氣/雨\n巴別塔臨時作戰指揮室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門外是Scout，他負責了昨夜的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是他效力於巴別塔後少有的任務失敗記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指揮官，女士，你們都在。我簡短說明一下昨晚的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小隊清掃戰場時，發現了可追蹤的敵軍痕跡。我判斷這是摸清敵軍位置的機會，執意循跡追擊而中了埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "責任在我，我願接受軍事處分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是一個老薩卡茲雇傭兵會做出的決斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，那一刻我的經驗並沒有對我做出警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "經驗不會被沒發生的事喚醒。危機發生後，沒有隊員戰死，說明撤退時你的指揮冷靜、得當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你應當得到表彰，而非處分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白這個結論是如何得出的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "軍隊的紀律若不能做到賞罰分明，則失去存在的意義。Scout，這個道理你一定明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼那麼在乎她的名譽？我需要一個理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凱爾希女士，瑞卡的情況怎麼樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她已經脫離了危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout想開口說些什麼，卻欲言又止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的內心在鬥爭著。即使在戰場上，也未見你如此為難過。若能說出你的考慮，或許我們可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我堅持不讓瑞卡受到任何處分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為她是個孤兒？軍隊的紀律可承載不了氾濫的同情心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑞卡的父親曾是薩卡茲雇傭兵，死於內戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這在卡茲戴爾不算什麼新鮮事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑞卡的母親身患嚴重的礦石病，沒有撫養她的能力。特蕾西婭殿下知曉此事後，一直為她們家提供經濟上的資助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也沒什麼特別的。如果沒有更充分的理由......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑞卡參軍僅是為了報答殿下的恩情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她曾對我說，為殿下而戰是她唯一的願望，是她生命的全部......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請說下去，Scout，我在聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在卡茲戴爾，孩子們難有什麼願望，也難有想守護的事物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們只是被捲入戰爭，而後戰死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你希望保留瑞卡的名譽，延續她守護殿下的願望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout沒有回答，身經百戰的老兵又回歸了沉默。\n博士緩緩起身，伸手拍了拍Scout的肩膀。這是凱爾希沒有預料到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若剛才有任何冒犯，請原諒，我知道你一定會有很好的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的決定是，沒有人會受到處分。但這樣的處理結果是對軍紀的損害，必定會招致非議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Scout，我希望你和你的小隊在未來用行動回應質疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定。指揮官，女士，我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走之前答應我一件事。請至少把自己的生命和名譽，放在與其他隊員同等的高度上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_026",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......此外，可露希爾或許會找你商討倫蒂尼姆的問題，她很關心我在這件事上的立場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以和她多分享一些決策過程，畢竟她也是潛在的作戰成員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，你們也可以......聊些別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:27 A.M. 天氣/晴\n羅德島總工程師辦公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次又是什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，去倫蒂尼姆的事有定論了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仍在討論，行動本身確實存在風險。為什麼突然關心這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擔心你心情不好。我清楚你心底一定想去，卻要考慮羅德島面臨的危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糾結的時候可是最消耗精力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不存在糾結，羅德島的安全永遠在首位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果哪天你能隨心做想做的事該多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這事可瞞不過我，憑你與特蕾西婭的友誼，倫蒂尼姆的事你無法置身事外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與殿下無關。我只關心行動本身對羅德島的利弊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是這樣，總把責任掛在嘴邊，至少偶爾也該關心一下自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩的事丟給博士，我們兩個去喝一杯倒倒苦水，多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士已經很辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒也是，雖然博士失憶前後轉變挺大，但工作狂這點可完全沒變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，以前的博士可嚴肅了，還是現在這樣比較好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在這樣比較好欺負？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說了，你上次給博士試用的跑步機會無端浮空，必須觀看商品促銷廣告才能降落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可是限時大促銷，是在幫博士省錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你多為博士著想一些。沒人想在忙得焦頭爛額時再受一些驚嚇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，怎麼突然這麼嚴肅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是有點怕失憶前的博士吧，我現在總想搞點惡作劇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是最後那段日子裡，博士的表現越來越古怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下，可露希爾，相關話題到此為止。更禁止你對博士提起這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，我有分寸。對了凱爾希，去倫蒂尼姆前，我準備開展對“待規劃區”的整修，至少得對艦體材料進行加厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖說是一筆很大的開銷，但作為可靠的工程師，我認為這點程度的投資還是非常有必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以啊，我已經代表工程部決定了，奮戰三天三夜，讓“待規劃區”煥然一新！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有必要，“待規劃區”是全艦最堅固的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，這我可就有發言權了。“待規劃區”的正下方是無人機機庫，而機庫沒有任何支柱的支撐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一旦上方遭到破壞，機庫頂部就會變形，然後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，你幹嘛這樣盯著我，我害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是自己想去罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，我攤牌了，作為總工程師有片區域進不去我好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有我的考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總把秘密藏著可是會憋壞的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，什麼時候能把你知道的和我分享一些，不要都自己扛著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許......會有那麼一天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你剛剛是不是鬆口了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "康納郡的病患安置工作，今天會全部完成。近期需要你重新評估安置點的防衛力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫療部晚些時候會把相關資料轉交給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後類似事務將逐步轉交精英幹員負責，不分散你在更重要的議題上的精力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉打擾到各位了，大家都醒一醒。凱爾希醫生即將開始每日的例行巡房。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天的晚間巡房提早了不少呀......欸？還來了好多後勤部的幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這健忘的毛病什麼時候也該讓凱爾希醫生給治治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫護小姑娘連續一周來病房打招呼，說準備把大家轉移到康納郡的臨時醫療安置點。你這不是讓人家口舌全白費嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，不要緊的大伯，畢竟也是比較突然的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這邊再嘮叨一下，羅德島本艦近期會在維多利亞周邊開展一系列模擬演習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮到大家的安全，決定將各位暫時轉移到康納郡的醫療安置點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請大家放心，康納郡的醫護設施齊全，且大部分醫護人員也會陪同前往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看，這才是艾莉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊凱爾希醫生！您什麼時候站在我旁邊的？瞧我這眼神......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要緊，我也剛到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾莉，把這位病人今天的血液檢測報告遞給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你恢復得很快，礦石病也沒有任何加重的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能有今天全是托您的福。想當初礦石病急性發作的時候，您可是一天一夜沒闔眼地搶救，我這才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是我作為醫生的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來要宣讀轉移安置的相關協議，宣讀後需要你在協議上簽字。根據《羅德島礦石病收治規定》第四條......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生您歇歇，不用念啦，我完完全全地信任羅德島，直接讓我簽字就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝好意。但完整宣讀協議也是為了保障你的權益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾莉，時間有限，搬運病患的人手可能不太夠，去走廊上看看有沒有人能幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，博士？下午好呀，您怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下午好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "好久不見。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你現在有空嗎？我們這邊轉移安置病患的人手不太夠，可能需要你的幫忙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有空。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......行。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我非常願意幫忙。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以你現在的身體情況，我並不建議你從事體力勞作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "閒著也是閒著。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......我會努力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "總得讓我試試吧！別小看我！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......這不會是羅德島指揮官吧？就是小艾莉天天掛在嘴邊讚不絕口的那位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大......大叔您可別亂說！博士，我之前只是在向他們介紹羅德島呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒她說的那麼厲害。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我有這麼帥氣嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通感染者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓羅德島指揮官給我做轉移安置？這使不得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必推辭，哪怕是最細微的工作，羅德島所有人也都有義務參與。戰地指揮官的頭銜並不會改變什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "時間有限，正式開始轉移。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "節省時間。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "開始幹活吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "庫斯，你過來抬大伯的上半身，注意醫療設備連接線。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。艾莉，這台新的儀器是？之前從來沒有見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "融晶儀，萊茵生命CR-01實驗型，內置源石回路。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "中晚期礦石病患者體內被結晶填充，臟器易受損破裂。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "融晶儀透過能量的有序集中釋放對結晶進行消解。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的沒錯！我就說吧，博士果然什麼都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "庫斯，別那樣直接抬。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "庫斯，住手。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "庫斯，停下！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "左手把患者的雙手併攏放在自己頸側，右手抱緊雙腿......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對......對不起！之前凱爾希醫生主講的戰地搬運課程我聽得不太認真，很多知識點都沒有記住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種課程本就要靠實踐去加深記憶。可博士你又是如何知道的？我記得開課期間你都在薩爾貢出外勤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下意識就說出口了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可能我是天才吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一件事，阿米婭近期忙於倫蒂尼姆之行的各項評估，也請你抽出時間關心一下她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是羅德島的領袖，但她同時也是個孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:29 A.M. 天氣/陰\n巴別塔臨時作戰指揮室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是巴別塔的領袖，但同時也是礦石病患者。請重視自己的身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我建議你停止工作，立刻去休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，你還是這麼會關心人......啊，博士，請進來吧，我們沒有在討論機密事項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都聽到了。殿下，你是該保證足夠的睡眠時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚的作戰會議氣氛很微妙，想必消耗了你大量的精力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必擔心。倒是博士，我要為一些與會者的言辭道歉，他們無意冒犯，只是情緒稍有激動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們擔心我的安全，但我心裡明白，博士一定考慮了所有可能的情況。這是最優解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯想奪回戰爭的主動權。他深知你的優勢同時也是你的軟肋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他想不到的是，你會為薩卡茲人作出多大的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當阿斯卡綸率領的部隊出現在小鎮上時，他將會意識到自己敗局已定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你總是這麼令人安心。博士，聽你說話可比睡一覺讓人精神多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭疲憊的臉上展露出一絲欣慰的笑，這份笑容在她看向門外時變得更加溫柔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快進來。來這邊，坐我旁邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嬌小的卡特斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別探頭張望了，這裡沒有外人，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，凱爾希醫生，晚......晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是故意這麼晚還沒休息的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人會責怪你。讓我猜猜，做噩夢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不是的。我是聽到軍隊的集合聲醒過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我趴在窗戶上看，阿斯卡綸姐姐似乎帶著其他戰士在為遠行做準備......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們是有任務在身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......可是阿斯卡綸姐姐說過，她絕對不會離開殿下和我哪怕一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我擔心發生了什麼事，就想著偷偷來指揮室看一眼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭呀阿米婭，是博士交給了阿斯卡綸一個小任務，他們不用多久就會回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想想，博士指揮的戰鬥，哪一次不是速戰速決？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確......確實，如果是博士的意見，我就放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士是最能給人安全感的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，你該休息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_051",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這就回去！大家晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是令人憐愛的孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你來之前我確實在擔心......阿斯卡綸離開期間羅德島艦船的安全問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擔心是正常的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉長戰線的同時，包圍一個毫無戰略意義的小鎮。特雷西斯的真正目的無從得知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的安危倒是其次，更多的是擔心連累到艦上的研究人員和孩子們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但正如阿米婭所說，你確實能給人帶來安全感。在你指揮下所取得的戰果也令人無從置疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，凱爾希，戰爭勝利的那天，應該不遠了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才說的事，都是在你常規日程之外的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你還在聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我在聽。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "聽著呢，很清楚。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，怎樣才算真正地活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這問題有些突然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......沒想過。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這問題也太深刻了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "服從他人意志，失去前行的理由，這算活著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那不過是行屍走肉。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那是機器人吧？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保有軀體，抽離記憶，又算活著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那或許會活得有些茫然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這說的是我吧？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若二者擇其一，博士，你會如何抉擇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我選擇成為人，而非傀儡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我會選擇自由。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "誰會想做機器？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自由是有代價的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失去記憶後醒來，被迫去戰鬥，被迫見證犧牲。一路走來我們並未給你太多選擇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看著我的眼睛。告訴我，博士，你究竟為何而戰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我為反抗自己的命運而戰。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我為羅德島而戰。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我為守護這片大地而戰。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那請你不要忘記此刻的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使沒有人能理解，我們也必須要這樣走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，而你也會找到你的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
